  "notes": "### Fixed\n- Drag and drop now reorders tasks in the desktop app, with a line showing where the task will land. Subtasks move with their parent and stay under the same parent.\n- Up/Down and Alt+Up/Down on subtasks now move them past the next task you can see, even when completed or other-day tasks sit in between. The CLI and MCP skip completed tasks too.\n- Dropping files from Finder or Explorer into notes and task descriptions works in the desktop app.\n- Attach file adds the file where your cursor was, or at the end, instead of the top. Note lists and search show clean snippets, and Write mode shows attachment links as short file chips.",
